  "question": {
    "text": "There is a circular tube in a vertical plane. Two liquids which do not mix and of densities d<sub>1</sub> and d<sub>2</sub> are filled in the tube. Each liquid subtends 90<sup>o</sup> angle at centre. Radius joining their interface makes an angle <math> <mrow> </mrow></math><math><mrow><mi>&alpha;</mi></mrow></math><math><mrow> </mrow> </math>&nbsp;with vertical. Ratio <math> <mrow> <mfrac> <mrow> <msub> </msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow></math><math><mrow><mfrac><mrow><msub><mtext>d</mtext> <mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><mrow><msub> </msub> </mrow> <mrow> <msub> </msub></mrow><mrow><msub><mtext>d</mtext> <mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow></math><math><mrow><mfrac><mrow><msub> </msub> </mrow> </mfrac> </mrow> </math>&nbsp; is :<br /><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/5242e260-9578-4d8f-a2cc-e0cee11efa1f-image.png\" style=\"width: 180px; height: 170px;\" />",
    "image": null
  },
